  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "My partner was unable to play my world and I was utterly confused as to what could be causing the issue. Once they updated their vrc (which they hadn't in a while) it worked just fine. Not sure if this problem was specific to them not updating or non up-to-date-clients altogether but figured I'd post it and the surrounding circumstances/fix for documentation purposes. Don't go through the same panic I did. Sometimes if something isn't working for a specific person, they just need to update.",
